	(text "Wake logic: DRV5032FB (omnipolar, push-pull, 5 Hz) runs from VBAT and drives the LDO EN.\nPuck in cassette (magnet) -> OUT low -> LDO off, ESP32 unpowered (storage drain ~3 uA total).\nPuck leaves the tube -> OUT high -> 3V3 up -> ESP32-C3 boots and joins the relay chain.\nVBAT/2 divider -> IO0 (ADC1_CH0): 4.2 V -> 2.1 V, constant 2.1 uA drain." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eabed939-6318-4490-937b-d13f267a8b13"))
