	(text "GPIO map (ESP32-C3-MINI-1)\nIO0  BAT_ADC (ADC1_CH0)      IO6  SPI_SCK\nIO1  LORA_DIO0 (wake)        IO7  SPI_MOSI\nIO2  strap, 10k pull-up       IO8  strap, 10k pull-up\nIO3  LORA_DIO1 (wake)        IO9  BOOT button\nIO4  LORA_RST                IO10 LORA_NSS\nIO5  SPI_MISO                IO18/19 USB D-/D+\nIO20 STATUS_LED              IO21 U0TXD test pad\n\nPower: USB-C/pogo 5 V -> MCP73831 -> VBAT (3.0-4.2 V)\n  -> AP2112K-3.3 (600 mA, gated by hall) -> 3V3\nPeak 3V3 load ~0.45 A (Wi-Fi TX ~0.35 A + SX1276 TX)\nJST-PH polarity is NOT standard across LiPo vendors:\n  check the lead before plugging (no reverse protection).\nU1 footprint = ESP32-C6-MINI-1 land pattern\n  (same 13.2 x 16.6 mm LGA-53); verify before layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 292.1 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60d8e71d-f174-4802-bfad-f61e4136bfa8"))
